{"title":"Career Roadmap · Tech Law Consultant","role":"Tech Law Consultant","summary":"A Tech Law Consultant advises organizations on legal, regulatory, contractual and risk issues arising from technology and innovation.","facts":{"Current degree":"Law – LLB / BA LLB / BBA LLB / B.Com LLB / B.Sc LLB (Integrated)","Course":"Science & Technology Law (B.Sc LLB)"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Tech Law Consultant advises organizations on legal, regulatory, contractual and risk issues arising from technology and innovation."},{"type":"p","text":"The role combines:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Law","Technology","Regulation","Business","Risk Management"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"A Tech Law Consultant may work with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Technology companies"},{"text":"SaaS companies"},{"text":"AI companies"},{"text":"Fintech organizations"},{"text":"Cybersecurity companies"},{"text":"IT services companies"},{"text":"Healthcare technology companies"},{"text":"E-commerce platforms"},{"text":"Legal-tech companies"},{"text":"Consulting firms"},{"text":"Law firms"},{"text":"Corporate legal departments"},{"text":"Startups"},{"text":"Research organizations"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Typical responsibilities include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Technology-law research"},{"text":"Technology contract review"},{"text":"Privacy and data-protection analysis"},{"text":"Cyber-law advisory"},{"text":"AI governance"},{"text":"Intellectual-property analysis"},{"text":"Technology compliance"},{"text":"Regulatory impact assessment"},{"text":"Vendor-risk analysis"},{"text":"Digital-product legal review"},{"text":"Technology policy development"},{"text":"Legal risk reports"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Unlike a purely traditional legal role, a Tech Law Consultant must understand how the technology works and how it creates legal and business risks."}]},{"heading":"Career Pathway","kind":